{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16106312","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16106312","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1610631201:1":{"text":"どうしました？名前に何か問題でも？","source_cn":"怎么回事？他的名字怎么了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF9879F7F83736DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1610631202:1":{"text":"い、言えません……名前を、言おうとすると……うっ！しゃ、喋れな……舌が動かせなくなって……","source_cn":"我……我说不出来！他的名字……呜！一提到就讲不出话……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF89905D10FD62169","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610631203:1":{"text":"なら、紙に書くのはどうです？こちらに紙とペンがあります。","source_cn":"桌子上有纸笔，你试试写出来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4EDBE7E9EE3C85B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610631204:1":{"text":"……だ、だめです……名前を書こうとすると、手が動きません。","source_cn":"……也……也不行，我的手……写到他的名字时就会动不了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB52E639A7CFB7EF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610631205:1":{"text":"これは、特殊な<style=\"highlight\">守秘魔法</style>でしょうか……ドルシェさん、レヒラムの校長代理として、彼にかけられた魔法を解くことはできますか？","source_cn":"看来是种特殊的<style=highlight>守秘魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BCA78274F5D83C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610631206:1":{"text":"特殊な魔法ですから、すぐには無理でしょうねぇ……先生方と相談する必要があるざます。","source_cn":"咳，这种魔法很特别，不是一时半刻能够解决的……我需要和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CD483AFB4E6E95E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610631207:1":{"text":"では、守秘魔法の解除はお任せいたします。","source_cn":"那么解开守秘魔法限制这件事就拜托你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9036E078A695B411","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610631208:1":{"text":"ニールさん、他にも同じ契約を結んだ生徒はいますか？ご存じなら、彼らの名前も教えてください。","source_cn":"尼尔，你知不知道学校里有多少学生签订过这个契约？认不认...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BB465F41B9F18DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1610631209:1":{"text":"「魔力が増える契約」を知っている生徒は、大勢いるはずです……なので他にも契約した人はいると思いますが、誰かまでは……","source_cn":"有不少学生都私下听说过“能增加魔力的契约”这件事……或...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19E60E7E6EA6CE81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1610631210:1":{"text":"どう考えても、校則とメイジの掟に反することですから……契約してても、誰にも言わないと思います……","source_cn":"没有人会到处宣扬这件事的，谁都知道这违反了学校规定，也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBCE9366895020D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1610631211:1":{"text":"なら、あなたはどこでこの契約を知ったのですか？契約の方法は？","source_cn":"你从哪里知道这个魔力契约，又是怎样签约的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5327DA21D80B438","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1610631212:1":{"text":"契約は……ぐっ！い、言えません……！","source_cn":"在……呜！我……我说不出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47A1A20C540B72E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1610631213:1":{"text":"あなたと契約した人物は、学院の生徒かもしくは教職員ですか？","source_cn":"和你签订契约的是学校的人，某个学生或者教职工？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB04FA362AB7B54CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1610631214:1":{"text":"違います。あの人は、学院に来たことはな……うぐっ……","source_cn":"不是学校里的人。他从来不进学校……呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6F4E20FB5E2A40D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1610631215:1":{"text":"少なくとも、学院の関係者でないことは間違いないようですね。レヒラム以外で生徒たちがよく行く場所と言えば……ホルト商店街でしょうか？もしかして、ここに……？","source_cn":"看来你很确定他是校外人士。除了莱希拉姆内，学生最常去的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CCFE16F938CAA1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docu